"fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 1, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 11:06", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877677332,47288722,418]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=150058]-阿狼-[/uid] (2026-08-07 11:00):[/b]<br/><br/>[img]./mon_202608/07/axyfQ44-40ynKbT1kSa6-28.jpg[/img]<br/>ZSBD[/quote]<br/><br/>夺少？？？", "lou": 42, "content_length": 15, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 877677332, "postdatetimestamp": 1786072008}, {"pid": 877678949, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 0, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-07 11:10", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "观测到低位消费等跷跷板方向拉升", "lou": 43, "content_length": 30, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786072235}, {"pid": 877952937, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 24, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-10 10:41", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "已经出现放量滞胀迹象，这周估计预期回踩，减了一层宽基[del]睡前挂的隔夜s在最高点[s:ac:哭笑][/del]", "lou": 44, "content_length": 78, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786329696}, {"pid": 877955037, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 8192, "score": 19, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-10 10:56", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "关于导盒[img]./mon_202608/10/axyfQ43-1m8cZfT3cSyx-p6.jpg[/img]", "lou": 45, "content_length": 47, "attachs": [{"attachurl": "mon_202608/10/axyfQ43-1m8cZfT3cSyx-p6.jpg", "size": 149, "type": "img", "subid": 0, "url_utf8_org_name": "temp0583610Screenshot_2026_0810_105551.png", "dscp": "", "path": "mon_202608/10", "name": "axyfQ43-1m8cZfT3cSyx-p6.jpg", "ext": "jpg", "thumb": "120", "hash": ""}], "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786330596}, {"pid": 877994920, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 0, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-10 16:50", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877994804,47288722,554]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60925933]ywlight2468[/uid] (2026-08-10 16:49):[/b]<br/><br/>今天下午压力位是不是被突破了[/quote]<br/><br/>还差一点，在1.06区域", "lou": 46, "content_length": 25, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 877994804, "postdatetimestamp": 1786351837}, {"pid": 878002476, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 15, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-10 17:58", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "[E1786355964 0 0]\t", "content": "[quote][pid=877999765,47288722,555]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=64289495]生鱼片是死鱼片wk[/uid] (2026-08-10 17:31):[/b]<br/><br/>指数到你的点位区间了[s:ac:哭笑]这次肯定信你[/quote]<br/><br/>难得还有人记得呢，昨晚睡太晚了，大概算了一下到位置后的宽基点位挂了隔夜，300到了卖在最高，1000没到不过我上午手痒还是减了<br/>下午看的挺闷的，这样拉可以15分钟再走一个背离甚至摸下4000，但随他去吧，无非就是提前止盈时间布局下一段小浪<br/>周末观察某队又待增持了，主观觉得他们还要捡下来以后的筹码", "lou": 47, "content_length": 284, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 877999765, "postdatetimestamp": 1786355910}, {"pid": 878070298, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 39, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-11 12:37", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "在我说的大考位置呆了两天了，场外不愿意做多，场内也没给证券之类的信号，不如打游戏", "lou": 48, "content_length": 80, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786423034}, {"pid": 878117071, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 9, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-11 20:26", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878103088,47288722,609]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=64289495]生鱼片是死鱼片wk[/uid] (2026-08-11 17:43):[/b]<br/><br/>[s:a2:偷吃]p佬，赶紧算算这波点位回踩到多少，我好陪酒存钱补仓[/quote]<br/><br/>比较舒服的给上车点位是3884，再向下一点就是3846，感觉不太会到3800以下", "lou": 49, "content_length": 73, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 878103088, "postdatetimestamp": 1786451205}, {"pid": 878195570, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 23, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-12 15:23", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "刚醒，怎么个事，团建了？<br/>我没看出有买点啊", "lou": 50, "content_length": 40, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786519381}, {"pid": 878305241, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 2, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 13:50", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878304377,47288722,726]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=65329649]zippo578[/uid] (2026-08-13 13:42):[/b]<br/><br/>中证1000有点下坠<br/>不知道能不能兜得住<br/>得看2点后了[/quote]<br/><br/>别兜了，看它背离都看力竭了", "lou": 51, "content_length": 31, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 878304377, "postdatetimestamp": 1786600235}, {"pid": 878310757, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 8, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 14:38", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "笑嘻zsbd", "lou": 52, "content_length": 8, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786603130}, {"pid": 878311840, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 29, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 14:47", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "结构成了大概就不会说轻易上去了，下来吧大盘我和&amp;#128054;队都很想你", "lou": 53, "content_length": 69, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786603663}, {"pid": 878313519, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 31, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 15:01", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "睡了三天，中途都给我整不自信了", "lou": 54, "content_length": 30, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786604485}, {"pid": 878315092, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 45, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 15:12", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "跌了你们不是应该感到高兴吗，原来位置上去有多少空间，下来了把蛋塞进去那才赚的多", "lou": 55, "content_length": 78, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786605159}, {"pid": 878316020, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 12, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 15:19", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878315243,47288722,751]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=64289495]生鱼片是死鱼片wk[/uid] (2026-08-13 15:13):[/b]<br/><br/>你往前翻翻，挺多人已经直接梭了[s:a2:偷吃][/quote]<br/><br/>所以我看不懂，我真感觉铁盒没有性价比的买点，只有t点，狼大下午买的我更看不懂了，只能解释为手痒", "lou": 56, "content_length": 98, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 878315243, "postdatetimestamp": 1786605540}, {"pid": 878317285, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 13, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-13 15:28", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=878316305,47288722,752]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=65490615]子午卯酉甲乙丙丁[/uid] (2026-08-13 15:21):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大应该是把早上高抛的接回来了，然后看ABC的B快走完了。要逐步买到开始计划的仓位。[/quote]<br/><br/>我的理解是下午已经有高点无力的迹象的情况下，就单看铁盒的15分斜率也能估摸出60k大概率顶不住，会有更低点，当然，实在手痒买个1成0.5成无所谓，当做先s后b做了1个点的t", "lou": 57, "content_length": 164, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 878316305, "postdatetimestamp": 1786606133}, {"pid": 878370079, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 8192, "score": 20, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-14 00:36", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "其实&amp;#128054;队他们早就撤差不多了，感觉也是交给市场自己搞，结果场内哥几个发现都不想当先登那干脆砸一波下来，大家等着老大哥吸筹再冲或者自己再多拿点下面筹码等二波反，场内几批群体都知道谁砸的慢谁就是被挂的那个(纯主观脑补，请内资不要对号入座)<br/>说下后面要小心的情况，假如明天修复这个中枢反弹过不去那就还要下，小心追了被挂[img]./mon_202608/14/axyfQ2-mhpZeT1kShs-134.jpg[/img]<br/>按时间算应该是4-7个交易日的调整，但我目前也不太确定是该按10号那天算还是按今天开始调整算", "lou": 58, "content_length": 442, "attachs": [{"attachurl": "mon_202608/14/axyfQ2-mhpZeT1kShs-134.jpg", "size": 140, "type": "img", "subid": 0, "url_utf8_org_name": "temp8659245mmexport1786638316806.jpg", "dscp": "", "path": "mon_202608/14", "name": "axyfQ2-mhpZeT1kShs-134.jpg", "ext": "jpg", "thumb": "56", "hash": ""}], "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1786639005}, 